body:
Resolves issue #2756.

The following snippet can possibly trigger a `-Wpragma-clang-attribute` warning with Clang:
```
HWY_BEFORE_NAMESPACE();
namespace test {
namespace HWY_NAMESPACE {

}  // namespace HWY_NAMESPACE
}  // namespace test
HWY_AFTER_NAMESPACE();
```

This pull request fixes this issue by ignoring any `-Wpragma-clang-attribute` warnings caused by the following pragma:
```
  HWY_PRAGMA(clang attribute push(__attribute__((target(targets_str))),   \
                                  apply_to = function))
```
